WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.452
Let's connect Facebook Messenger to Recatch.

00:00:03.522 --> 00:00:05.387
Messenger connects with a Facebook

00:00:05.387 --> 00:00:06.759
Page, using your own Meta

00:00:06.759 --> 00:00:07.667
app for now.

00:00:07.967 --> 00:00:09.729
Step one. Create your

00:00:09.729 --> 00:00:11.908
account at recatch.app.

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:13.816
On the Create your workspace

00:00:13.816 --> 00:00:15.718
screen, enter your name, your

00:00:15.718 --> 00:00:17.293
email, and a password of

00:00:17.293 --> 00:00:18.986
at least 8 characters.

00:00:19.056 --> 00:00:20.539
Then click Create account.

00:00:20.839 --> 00:00:21.860
Step two. You land

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:23.414
on the Channels screen.

00:00:23.484 --> 00:00:25.747
Under Connect a channel, click Messenger.

00:00:26.047 --> 00:00:28.236
Step three. In Meta for Developers,

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:30.112
add Messenger to your app.

00:00:30.182 --> 00:00:32.039
Generate a Page access token

00:00:32.039 --> 00:00:34.692
with the pages_messaging permission, and

00:00:34.692 --> 00:00:36.732
note your Facebook Page ID.

00:00:36.802 --> 00:00:39.036
These values are fake examples.

00:00:39.036 --> 00:00:40.981
Never share your real token

00:00:40.981 --> 00:00:42.240
or app secret.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.805
Step four. Paste the Facebook Page

00:00:44.805 --> 00:00:46.988
ID and the Page access token.

00:00:47.058 --> 00:00:49.605
Adding your App secret is recommended.

00:00:49.605 --> 00:00:52.470
It's used to verify webhook signatures.

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:55.044
Step five. Click Connect account.

00:00:55.344 --> 00:00:57.656
Recatch now shows a Callback URL

00:00:57.656 --> 00:00:59.896
and a Verify token, under Paste

00:00:59.896 --> 00:01:02.169
into the Meta App dashboard.

00:01:02.469 --> 00:01:03.859
Step six. Paste both

00:01:03.859 --> 00:01:05.777
into Messenger webhooks.

00:01:05.847 --> 00:01:11.069
Subscribe to messages, messaging_postbacks, and messaging_referrals.

00:01:11.369 --> 00:01:13.658
That's it. Messenger is connected.

00:01:13.728 --> 00:01:15.480
Next, build your first flow,

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:17.545
from the lead-capture template or

00:01:17.545 --> 00:01:18.734
a blank canvas.
